"{\"summary\": \"The diff adds a `symbols_only` flag to `load_facts_file` and passes it from `_write_facts_symbols_for_read`, and adds `graph_parts`/`_line_part` in mcp.py that locate a single line per symbol or hit via `location_part(root, file_path, line, line)`, with all graph tools routed through `_answer`/`nib_answer`. It also adds measurement support (metrics, file_metrics, all_metrics, bulk reads) to the sqlite and subtree providers, a migration adding `lines`/`comment_lines` columns and clearing mtime stamps, and metric row insertion/deletion in the store.\", \"ranges\": [[295, 334], [344, 361], [630, 660], [907, 914], [994, 1002]]}"